            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Barney"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe had far too much milk and came out soupy. I re-baked it 20 minutes and gave it 5 minutes under the broiler, but it didn't help. I wonder if there was a misprint and it should have designated condensed or evaporated milk? I will not chance making this recipe again.\n\nBarney, Greensboro, NC",
